{
 "_note": "Pins for the Oz engine (engine/build_engine.py). game_code is the ioquake3 tree the QVMs build from (game/patches on a pinned commit). upstream holds the last synced commit of each engine the blend takes from (engine/tools/upstream_report.py reads and updates it). libs are built from source by build_engine.py; later phases add theirs when their phase starts. A lib without \"cmake\" is only fetched. {src}, {build}, {thirdparty} and {d} (\"d\" in Debug builds) are filled in. A \"linux\" entry holds what differs on Linux (engine/build_engine.py run in WSL2 or on Linux): its \"cmake\" definitions replace the same-named ones, its \"engine_cmake\" entries and \"program\" replace those, and its \"stage\" replaces the list, its \"after\" builds it after the lib named (a staged name may hold a glob, for the libraries' versioned .so files).",
 "libs": {
